[background arg="res://assets/misc/black.png" fade="0.0"]
join latern right [animation="Instant In"]
join anemon left
anemon: Hello I'm Anne, and this is Joe.
latern: ...
anemon: Is everything alright ?
latern: AH!
latern: Who are you ?!
anemon: As I was saying I'm Anne, and this little guy here is Joe.
joe: We're the detectives in charge of the investigaion. And I'm not small. I'm actually quite large for a clownfish !
latern: Oh. Of course.  I am Edmond, but call me Ed. Ed Light. I'm the resident librarian of WhaleBack.
anemon: What scared you so much just now ? Is heavy burden plaging you ?
latern: I am sleeping. Or trying to. Some seek light to guide their path their entire lives, I bask in it every waking hour. Yet without shadow light does not guide but blind. Devoid of contrast I cannot discern anymore.
[wait time="2.0"]
latern: Sorry. I am always a little tense what with sleep-deprevation. Shrimp's passing has made me positively fraught.
anemon: Speaking of Shrimp, what do you know about her death ?
[wait time="2.0"]
latern: I am the one who found her in the Library. Her body was crushed under books. Her entrails splattered on the floor.
anemon: And what were doing before you found her ?
latern: After eating along with the others in the cafeteria I went back to the library to put some order in it. I thought I may meet Shrimp there since she had left the table earlier. She was the most regular user of the library and always put it upside down every time she read or borrowed a book. It is beyond me how one can be so messy.
latern: She wasn't there this time though. So I simply ordered some books before going to Abigawhale. We had some accounting to sort out. It's only after spending time with Abigawhale that I went back to the library and found Shrimp's remains.
leave latern
update anemon (Alone)
join joe right
joe: This one is unhinged.
anemon: I like her. I like her a [b]lot[/b]!
joe: Of course you would! You really should see a shrink some day Anne.
anemon: No thanks, I really don't wanna be as small as you !
if {NextDialogue.couple} == "meeting_couple":
	set {NextDialogue.lantern} = "nothing_whale"
else:
	jump lantern_cart/chained